am", "tribhaṅgalalitākāraṃ cārucūḍāvirājitam", "pītāṃśukaparīdhānaṃ vanamālāvibhūṣitam", "kadambakusumopetaṃ śravaṇaṃ janamohitam", "āraktanayanadvandvaṃ koṭividyutsamadyutim", "āraktakaratalasvacchaṃ guñjamālāvirājitam", "evaṃrūpaṃ samutpannaṃ hṛdi madhye varānane", "śūnyamadhye sthitā devi kāmabījasvarūpiṇī", "sarveṣu viṣṇumantreṣu kāmabījaṃ parātparam", "tato vai kāmabījāttu jāyate viṣṇuvigraham", "kāminī yā maheśāni viṣṇumātā pragīyate", "kakāraḥ kāminī sākṣād lakāraḥ pṛthivīśvarī", "binduḥ kuṇḍalinīrūpaṃ śivaśaktimayaṃ priye", "nirakṣaro viṣṇudevo hyakṣarājjāyate dhruvam", "klīṃkārabījarūpā yā sā parā parigīyate", "kāminī sā maheśāni pṛthivī tasya āsanam", "vasate kāminī devī bindutrayasamanvitā", "anena prajapenmantraṃ huṃkāraṃ varavarṇini", "prakṛtiḥ paramārādhyā devānāṃ naganandini", "ṣaṣṭhasvaraḥ paricayo viyadbījaṃ śaśiprabham", "kāmamanmathakandarpam akṣaradhvajasaṃjñakam", "māyākūrcaṃ vadhūbījaṃ lakṣmībījañca pārvati", "sapiṇḍavattathā devi yeṣu yāsu ca vidyate", "evaṃ bījaṃ sakṛd dhyātvā sarvāsāṃ bhavati priyaḥ", "evaṃ hi daśadhā kṛtvā mantrāṇāṃ bījasādhanam", "devadhyānaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā iṣṭamantraṃ tato japet", "evaṃ hi daśadhā kṛtvā devādhiṣṭhānameva ca", "tanmantraṃ prajapeddevi evaṃ siddhimupālabhe", "akṛtvā dhyānatattvañca aṣṭatattvaṃ tathaiva ca", "tato jīvatvamāpnoti mantraḥ sidhyati tatkṣaṇāt", "praṇavapuṭitaṃ kṛtvā anulomavilomataḥ", "ekadhā vā tridhā kṛtvā yadi kuryād varānane", "jīvatvaṃ hi vinā devi yadi mantraṃ japet sudhīḥ", "sadā nidrāturo mantrī jīvahīnaśca pārvati", "jīvanyāsena cārvaṅgi nidrābhaṅgo bhaved dhruvam", "prāṇatattvañca cārvaṅgi devatattvaṃ tathaiva ca", "akṣare akṣare devi ajñātvā prajaped yadi", "kevalaṃ kalikābījaṃ tadvarṇaṃ surapūjite", "mataṃ śrīvāsudevasya iti te kathitaṃ priye", "etanmantraprabhāvāddhi kālakūṭaṃ pibāmyaham", "ete varṇā varārohe mahāyogamayāḥ sadā", "yogamārge bhaktimārge muktimārge ca sundari", "etāstu yuvatīvarṇāḥ kāryakāraṇarūpiṇaḥ", "etanmantramavijñāya purāṇaṃ saṃhitāṃ smṛtim", "sarvadharmeṣu yatkarm